<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Fattoria Il Bosco D'Obaca | Ortaggi, Frutta e Uova a Km Zero a Vellano (Pescia)</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Il gusto genuino della Svizzera Pesciatina direttamente a casa tua. Coltiviamo ortaggi di stagione, frutta e uova fresche colorate a Vellano (Pescia).">
    
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        bosco: '#243E22', /* Verde bosco profondo e naturale */
                        boscoDark: '#172B16',
                        boscoLight: '#32562F',
                        terra: '#7A4A35', /* Marrone terra calda */
                        terraDark: '#5C3727',
                        gialloCaldo: '#D99B26', /* Giallo caldo accogliente */
                        gialloCaldoDark: '#B87E1B',
                        gialloCaldoHover: '#C6871F',
                        panna: '#F9F8F3',
                        pannaCard: '#F3EFE6',
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        serif: ['Playfair Display', 'Georgia', 'serif'],
                        sans: ['Montserrat', 'sans-serif'],
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <!-- FontAwesome for Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            background-color: #F9F8F3;
            color: #2D3748;
        }
        h1, h2, h3, h4, .font-serif {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
        }
        /* Custom scrollbar for AI chat box */
        .chat-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
        }
        .chat-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #F3EFE6;
        }
        .chat-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #D99B26;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-panna text-gray-800 antialiased selection:bg-bosco selection:text-white">

    <header class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-panna/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-terra/10 transition-all duration-300" id="navbar">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-20 flex items-center justify-between">
            <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-bosco/30 shadow-md group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform flex-shrink-0 bg-white">
                    <img src="logo.jpeg" alt="Logo Fattoria Il Bosco D'Obaca" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span class="block font-serif font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-bosco tracking-wide">Fattoria Il Bosco D'Obaca</span>
                    <span class="block text-xs text-terra font-medium tracking-widest uppercase">Vellano • Pescia</span>
                </div>
            </a>

            <!-- Desktop Nav -->
            <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 font-medium text-sm">
                <a href="#home" class="text-bosco font-semibold hover:text-gialloCaldoDark transition-colors">Home</a>
                <a href="#chisiamo" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-bosco transition-colors">Chi Siamo</a>
                <a href="#prodotti" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-bosco transition-colors">Prodotti & Futuro</a>
                <a href="#ordina" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-bosco transition-colors">Come Acquistare</a>
                <a href="#faq" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-bosco transition-colors">FAQ</a>
                <a href="#contatti" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-bosco transition-colors">Contatti</a>
            </nav>

            <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-4">
                <a href="#ordina" class="bg-gialloCaldo hover:bg-gialloCaldoHover text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full font-semibold text-sm shadow-lg shadow-gialloCaldo/20 transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-basket-shopping mr-2"></i>Ordina Cassetta
                </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Mobile Menu Button -->
            <button id="menu-btn" class="md:hidden text-bosco text-2xl focus:outline-none p-2" aria-label="Menu">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-bars"></i>
            </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Mobile Menu Drawer -->
        <div id="mobile-menu" class="hidden md:hidden bg-panna border-b border-terra/10 px-6 pt-4 pb-6 space-y-4 shadow-xl">
            <a href="#home" class="block font-medium text-bosco mobile-link">Home</a>
            <a href="#chisiamo" class="block font-medium text-gray-700 mobile-link">Chi Siamo</a>
            <a href="#prodotti" class="block font-medium text-gray-700 mobile-link">Prodotti & Futuro</a>
            <a href="#ordina" class="block font-medium text-gray-700 mobile-link">Come Acquistare</a>
            <a href="#faq" class="block font-medium text-gray-700 mobile-link">FAQ</a>
            <a href="#contatti" class="block font-medium text-gray-700 mobile-link">Contatti</a>
            <div class="pt-2">
                <a href="#ordina" class="block text-center bg-gialloCaldo text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold shadow-md mobile-link">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-basket-shopping mr-2"></i>Ordina Cassetta
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section id="home" class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center pt-24 pb-16 overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-pannaCard to-panna">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-10 bg-[radial-gradient(#243E22_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:16px_16px]"></div>
            
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 w-full py-12">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
                    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-center lg:text-left">
                        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-bosco/10 text-bosco px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i> Vellano • Svizzera Pesciatina
                        </div>
                        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-boscoDark leading-tight">
                            Il gusto genuino della Svizzera Pesciatina, <span class="text-gialloCaldoDark italic">direttamente a casa tua.</span>
                        </h1>
                        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 font-normal leading-relaxed">
                            Coltiviamo ortaggi di stagione, frutta, more e uova fresche colorate da galline felici allevate all'aperto a Vellano.
                        </p>
                        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 pt-4">
                        <a href="#ordina" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-gialloCaldo hover:bg-gialloCaldoHover text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-semibold text-center shadow-lg shadow-gialloCaldo/25 transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-basket-shopping"></i> Ordina la tua cassetta
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- Quick trust indicators -->
                        <div class="pt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-terra/10 max-w-lg mx-auto lg:mx-0">
                            <div>
                                <span class="block font-serif font-bold text-2xl text-bosco">100%</span>
                                <span class="text-xs text-gray-600">Naturale & Sostenibile</span>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <span class="block font-serif font-bold text-2xl text-bosco">Km 0</span>
                                <span class="text-xs text-gray-600">Filiera Cortissima</span>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <span class="block font-serif font-bold text-2xl text-bosco">All'aperto</span>
                                <span class="text-xs text-gray-600">Galline Felicissime</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
                        <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-md lg:max-w-none">
                            <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gialloCaldo/20 rounded-3xl transform rotate-3 filter blur-sm"></div>
                            <!-- Foto di un orto con pacciamatura di fieno tra il bosco -->
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1589923188900-85dae523342b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Orto con pacciamatura di fieno tra il bosco a Vellano" class="relative rounded-2xl shadow-2xl object-cover w-full h-[450px]">
                            <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl shadow-xl flex items-center gap-4 border border-terra/10 max-w-xs">
                                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-bosco/10 flex items-center justify-center text-bosco text-xl">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-egg"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <span class="block font-bold text-sm text-gray-900">Uova Fresche Colorate</span>
                                    <span class="text-xs text-gray-600">Azzurre, verdi e nocciola</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="chisiamo" class="py-20 bg-white">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
                    <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative">
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500937386664-56d1dfef3854?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Eleonora e Valentin" class="rounded-2xl shadow-md object-cover h-64 w-full">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1592417817098-8f3d69204b56?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Castagneto Vellano" class="rounded-2xl shadow-md object-cover h-64 w-full mt-8">
                        </div>
                        <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-bosco text-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl text-center hidden sm:block">
                            <span class="block font-serif text-3xl font-bold">2</span>
                            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">Fondatori Appassionati</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
                        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-terra/10 text-terra px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-tree"></i> Chi Siamo
                        </div>
                        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-boscoDark leading-tight">
                            Un progetto agricolo che stiamo costruendo con le nostre mani
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
                            Siamo <strong>Eleonora e Valentin</strong>: viviamo e lavoriamo a Vellano, nel cuore della Svizzera Pesciatina, dove stiamo dando vita passo dopo passo alla nostra fattoria. Abbiamo scelto di costruire da zero la nostra realtà agricola, rigenerando la terra e recuperando un antico castagneto abbandonato.
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
                            Coltiviamo il nostro orto e la nostra frutta seguendo rigorosamente i ritmi e gli equilibri della natura, adottando metodi totalmente naturali e sostenibili. Insieme alle uova fresche delle nostre galline allevate all'aria aperta, lavoriamo ogni giorno per offrirti cibi autentici, sani e coltivati in modo trasparente.
                        </p>
                        
                        <div class="p-5 bg-pannaCard rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-bosco">
                            <p class="italic font-serif text-bosco text-sm sm:text-base">
                                "Coltiviamo l'orto seguendo i ritmi della natura, recuperiamo un antico castagneto abbandonato e alleviamo le nostre galline all'aria aperta per portarvi in ogni stagione i sapori veri, sani e genuini della nostra terra."
                            </p>
                            <span class="block mt-2 text-xs font-bold text-terra uppercase tracking-wider">— Eleonora & Valentin</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="pt-4">
                            <a href="#contatti" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-bosco font-bold hover:text-gialloCaldoDark transition-colors">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i> Vieni a conoscerci in fattoria
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="prodotti" class="py-20 bg-pannaCard">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-4">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-bosco/10 text-bosco px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-carrot"></i> Dalla Terra alla Tavola
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-boscoDark">
                        Cosa c'è Oggi in Fattoria vs. Progetti Futuri
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">
                        Scopri le nostre produzioni attuali a km zero e guarda cosa stiamo realizzando per il futuro grazie al nostro impegno e allo sviluppo agricolo.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Offerta Attuale Grid -->
                <div class="mb-16">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-bosco text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">1</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-bosco">Offerta Attuale (Disponibile Ora)</h3>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                        <!-- Card 1 -->
                        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-terra/10 hover:shadow-xl transition-all flex flex-col">
                            <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden relative">
                                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540420773420-3366772f4999?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Le Cassette dell'Orto" class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500">
                                <span class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-gialloCaldo text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow">Disponibile</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-bosco mb-2">Le Cassette dell'Orto</h4>
                                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                        Ortaggi freschi di stagione coltivati con metodi totalmente naturali e sostenibili nei nostri campi a Vellano.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                <a href="#ordina" class="text-gialloCaldoDark font-semibold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:underline">
                                    Ordina la cassetta <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-xs"></i>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Card 2 -->
                        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-terra/10 hover:shadow-xl transition-all flex flex-col">
                            <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden relative">
                                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1610832958506-aa56368176cf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Frutta Fresca e More" class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500">
                                <span class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-gialloCaldo text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow">Disponibile</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-bosco mb-2">Frutta Fresca & More</h4>
                                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                        Frutta locale di stagione e deliziose more mature raccolte direttamente dai nostri alberi e roveti nel bosco.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                <a href="#ordina" class="text-gialloCaldoDark font-semibold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:underline">
                                    Scopri il raccolto <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-xs"></i>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Card 3 -->
                        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-terra/10 hover:shadow-xl transition-all flex flex-col">
                            <div class="h-48 overflow-hidden relative">
                                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516467508483-a7212febe31a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Uova Fresche Colorate" class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500">
                                <span class="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-gialloCaldo text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow">Disponibile</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-bosco mb-2">Uova Fresche Colorate</h4>
                                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                        Uova dal guscio azzurro/verde, marrone e nocciola prodotte da galline felici allevate all'aperto all'aria di montagna.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                                <a href="#ordina" class="text-gialloCaldoDark font-semibold text-sm inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:underline">
                                    Prenota uova <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-xs"></i>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Progetti Futuri Grid -->
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-8">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-terra text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">2</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-terraDark">Progetti Futuri (In Cantiere - Bando di Sviluppo)</h3>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                        <!-- Future Card 1 -->
                        <div class="bg-white/85 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border-2 border-dashed border-terra/30 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-center">
                            <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-terra/10 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-terra text-3xl">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-house-chimney"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="space-y-2">
                                <span class="inline-block bg-terra/20 text-terraDark text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">In Arrivo</span>
                                <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-bosco">La Nuova Stalla e le Caprette</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                    Stalla moderna pensata per il massimo benessere animale, progettata per ospitare circa 30 capre da latte in armonia con la natura di Vellano.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Future Card 2 -->
                        <div class="bg-white/85 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border-2 border-dashed border-terra/30 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 items-center">
                            <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-terra/10 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-terra text-3xl">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-cheese"></i>
                            </div>
                            <div class="space-y-2">
                                <span class="inline-block bg-terra/20 text-terraDark text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">In Arrivo</span>
                                <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-bosco">Il Laboratorio e i Formaggi Artigianali</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                    Caseificio aziendale per la produzione e vendita di formaggi freschi e stagionati a filiera cortissima direttamente in fattoria.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="ordina" class="py-20 bg-white">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-4">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-bosco/10 text-bosco px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bag-shopping"></i> Guida & Ordini
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-boscoDark">
                        Come Acquistare la Tua Cassetta Settimanale
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">
                        Bastano 3 semplici passaggi per ricevere sulla tua tavola la genuinità dei nostri prodotti di stagione.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- 3 Steps Grid -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-20">
                    <div class="bg-panna p-8 rounded-2xl border border-terra/10 relative text-center">
                        <div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-bosco text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">1</div>
                        <div class="text-gialloCaldoDark text-4xl mb-4 mt-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-bosco mb-2">Richiedi la Cassetta</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
                            Consulta la nostra offerta di stagione sul sito web oppure direttamente sul nostro canale WhatsApp aggiornato.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-panna p-8 rounded-2xl border border-terra/10 relative text-center">
                        <div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-bosco text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">2</div>
                        <div class="text-gialloCaldoDark text-4xl mb-4 mt-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-bosco mb-2">Invia il Tuo Ordine</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
                            Compila il modulo qui sotto oppure rispondi su WhatsApp indicando se preferisci il ritiro in fattoria o la consegna.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-panna p-8 rounded-2xl border border-terra/10 relative text-center">
                        <div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-bosco text-white font-bold flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">3</div>
                        <div class="text-gialloCaldoDark text-4xl mb-4 mt-2">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-house-laptop"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-bosco mb-2">Ricevi o Ritira</h3>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">
                            Passa a trovarci a Vellano in Via Obaca oppure ricevi la cassetta comoda a casa con la nostra consegna locale in zona.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Interactive Order Form & WhatsApp Option Box -->
